flowchart TB
  accTitle: Background job architecture
  accDescr: The browser submits work through an API. A worker reads a queue and stores results.
  Browser -->|submit job| API
  subgraph Service[Job service]
    API -->|enqueue| Queue
    Queue -->|job| Worker
    Worker -->|save result| Database[(Database)]
    API -->|read result| Database
  end
  classDef focus fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#2563eb,color:#172033
  class Worker focus
